  "text": "2013A08 Draw a diagramme of the larynx, as\nit would be seen at direct laryngoscopy. Label the important\nanatomical structures.\nList:\n1.\nTrachea and rings\n2.\nTrue vocal folds (glottis)\n3.\nFalse vocal folds = ventricular folds\n4.\nLaryngeal ventricle\n5.\nAnterior commissure\n6.\nEpiglottis\n7.\nPosterior commissure\n8.\nArytenoids\n9.\nCorniculate tubercle\n10.\nCuneiform tubercle\n11.\nQuadrangular membrane\n12.\nAryepiglottic fold\n13.\nMedian glossoepiglottic ligament\n14.\nBase of tongue\n15.\nPiriform fossa\n16.\nOesophagus",
